<h1>@Localizer["Metals: choose the grade and its condition"]</h1>
<p class="docs-lead">@Localizer["A good metal choice balances function with the way a part will be machined, joined, finished, and maintained. Use these families to form a shortlist, then obtain the exact product specification. Examples illustrate engineering decisions and do not establish local stock availability or a qualified design."]</p>
